returns = range(1, 16)
# return with the smallest gap between 72 / r and the exact doubling time
```
:::


::: {.hint exercise="fv_3_py"}
The exact time is `math.log(2) / math.log(1 + r / 100)`. Use `min(returns, key=lambda r: abs(...))`.
:::

::: {.solution exercise="fv_3_py"}
```python
